# ---- E6. DIRECTION of bias (two-legged table, Table 3.2) -------------
#                         corr(X1,X2) > 0     corr(X1,X2) < 0
#   beta2 > 0 (X2 raises Y)   UPWARD           DOWNWARD
#   beta2 < 0 (X2 lowers Y)   DOWNWARD         UPWARD
